      "id": 1,
      "text": "After the Tennessee Midland Railway reached Beech Bluff in 1888‑1890, the community officially adopted the name Beech Bluff, named for a nearby beech‑tree‑lined bluff.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
