      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beech_Bluff%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Beech Bluff is built on deposits of loess which have developed brown or grayish brown silt loam soils.",
